{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/0b445871cfae3b3bdf522cbd7b305a53.avif?t=1768029047\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of the Lake</strong> is an atmospheric <strong>cinematic visual novel</strong> in the genre of psychological horror, inspired by the style of classic cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a pioneer camp by a mysterious lake, where an ordinary summer slowly begins to crack apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Janis, a boy who arrives at the camp filled with carefree voices, the scent of pine trees, and the sound of flagpoles.<br>Everything feels familiar and right\u2026<br>until you begin to sense that <strong>reality can be more terrifying than any nightmare</strong>,<br>and you are forced to experience it firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/521d2450ad359b552770dd1c97e7b6c0.poster.avif?t=1768029047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/521d2450ad359b552770dd1c97e7b6c0.webm?t=1768029047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/521d2450ad359b552770dd1c97e7b6c0.mp4?t=1768029047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about childhood that never truly lets go.<br>About a secret hidden beneath a calm surface, and an attempt to understand<br>what really happened back then \u2014 and why the past still keeps pulling you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps, by telling this story, you too will feel the call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DARE YOU LOOK INTO THE PAST, IF IT CALLS YOU FROM THE DEPTHS?</strong> \ud83d\udc80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/708e96bde61221036806cb1fb83eda5c.poster.avif?t=1768029047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/708e96bde61221036806cb1fb83eda5c.webm?t=1768029047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/708e96bde61221036806cb1fb83eda5c.mp4?t=1768029047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Cinematic presentation and non-standard format</strong> \u2014 the game is designed as a cinematic visual novel with a strong focus on visual rhythm, atmosphere, and immersion.<br>Short cinematic video sequences are used at key moments to enhance the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Pioneer camp atmosphere</strong> \u2014 summer, friendship, and a disturbing secret beneath the surface of a familiar world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Non-linear narrative with multiple endings</strong> \u2014 your choices determine how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Rich sound design</strong> \u2014 realistic ambient sounds, wind, whispers, and original music create a constant sense of pressure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118240?t=1768029047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/a1ef2ce8ac04ff7ed894b700b373c6f19345ba0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768029047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/5dcd1255403f35f5372c3aad9015b020ca660252/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768029047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/5dcd1255403f35f5372c3aad9015b020ca660252/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768029047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mild psychological horror elements, a tense atmosphere, and occasional frightening imagery."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/extras/0b445871cfae3b3bdf522cbd7b305a53.avif?t=1768029047\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call of the Lake</strong> is an atmospheric <strong>cinematic visual novel</strong> in the genre of psychological horror, inspired by the style of classic cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a pioneer camp by a mysterious lake, where an ordinary summer slowly begins to crack apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Janis, a boy who arrives at the camp filled with carefree voices, the scent of pine trees, and the sound of flagpoles.<br>Everything feels familiar and right\u2026<br>until you begin to sense that <strong>reality can be more terrifying than any nightmare</strong>,<br>and y