"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Cinematic presentation and non-standard format</strong> \u2014 the game is designed as a cinematic visual novel with a strong focus on visual rhythm, atmosphere, and immersion.<br>Short cinematic video sequences are used at key moments to enhance the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Pioneer camp atmosphere</strong> \u2014 summer, friendship, and a disturbing secret beneath the surface of a familiar world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Non-linear narrative with multiple endings</strong> \u2014 your choices determine how the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Rich sound design</strong> \u2014 realistic ambient sounds, wind, whispers, and original music create a constant sense of pressure.</p>","developers":["StarryFrame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118240/a49b6d587b671dc2f8ac6a2baf3995a70bd0ddc8/header.jpg?t=1768029047","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118240/727034769/a526b53849146d16f79a5718c617bdf141c91720/1766590696/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766591305","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118240/727034769/a526b